  <!--EN: An espresso machine brews coffee by forcing pressurized water near boiling point through a "puck" of ground coffee and a filter in order to produce a thick, concentrated coffee called espresso. This particular machine also has the possibility of brewing tea using a separate system.-->
  <VBE_EspressoMachineBuilding.description>浓缩咖啡机通过迫使接近沸点的加压水通过磨碎咖啡的“冰球”和过滤器来冲泡咖啡，从而产生一种浓稠、浓缩的咖啡，称为浓缩咖啡。这种特殊的机器还可以使用单独的系统泡茶。</VBE_EspressoMachineBuilding.description>
  <!--EN: espresso machine-->
  <VBE_EspressoMachineBuilding.label>浓缩咖啡机</VBE_EspressoMachineBuilding.label>
  <!--EN: Whiskey and coffee blended thoroughly before forming a head and being topped with a spoonful of whipped cream. Perfect for those who just got out of bed and are already wanting to go back to it.-->
  <VBE_IrishCoffee.description>威士忌和咖啡充分混合，然后形成泡沫，并在上面淋上一勺生奶油。非常适合那些刚刚起床并已经想回去睡觉的人。</VBE_IrishCoffee.description>
