  <!--EN: irish coffee-->
  <VBE_IrishCoffee.label>爱尔兰咖啡</VBE_IrishCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: A sugary tea left out to ferment, after fermenting the end product is a sweet and sour, sometimes even naturally fizzy drink known as kombucha. Praised for health benefits, though some remain skeptical. Kombucha acts as a home remedy against the flu, reducing its severity by 5%.-->
  <VBE_Kombucha.description>留下发酵的含糖茶，发酵后的最终产品是一种酸甜的，有时甚至是天然的碳酸饮料，称为康普茶。因其对健康的益处而受到赞扬，但有些人仍持怀疑态度。康普茶是对抗流感的家庭疗法，可将流感的严重程度降低 5%。</VBE_Kombucha.description>
  <!--EN: Drink {0}-->
  <VBE_Kombucha.ingestible.ingestCommandString>喝{0}</VBE_Kombucha.ingestible.ingestCommandString>
