  <!--EN: Cheap, mass produced generic coffee seeped in an array of spices, oddly excluding any actual pumpkin. Thousands of years ago, this type of coffee was stereotypically consumed by red-haired hipsters with man buns.-->
  <VBE_PumpkinCoffee.description>廉价、批量生产的普通咖啡中渗入了一系列香料，奇怪的是不包括任何真正的南瓜。几千年前，这种咖啡的典型消费对象是红发时髦人士，头戴男士小圆面包。</VBE_PumpkinCoffee.description>
