  <!--EN: A mixture of coffee and tea. Tea and coffee drinkers respectively set their differences aside while concocting this unholy amalgamation. It is usually served cold, but whether it’s served hot or cold it’s equally confusing to the imbiber.-->
  <VBE_Yuenyeung.description>咖啡和茶的混合物。喝茶和喝咖啡的人在调制这种邪恶的混合物时分别搁置了他们的差异。它通常是冷饮，但无论是热还是冷饮，对于饮用者来说都同样令人困惑。</VBE_Yuenyeung.description>
